\newlabel{fig:pup-ground-mem}{{4.12}{37}{PUP, C++ backend: grounding time and peak memory. \texttt {ga} pays the heuristic unrolling (orange) on top of the base growth; \texttt {la} (green) pays the base program only, and stays consistently cheaper at every common size}{figure.4.12}{}}
