\newlabel{fig:pup-comparison}{{4.13}{38}{PUP: native-versus-Prolog solving comparison (left) and cumulative synchronization cost of the Prolog backend (right). For \texttt {la} the synchronization, not the query, is the dominant lazy cost at scale}{figure.4.13}{}}
