\newlabel{tab:alpha-frontier}{{4.9}{41}{Largest instance solved within the 600\,s / 30\,GB budget, and its cost, ordered by reach within each family. Wall time and peak RSS are \texttt {runlim} measures, the only ones commensurable across the two systems; Alpha's RSS includes the reserved JVM heap. clingo rows are the C++ backend. A dash marks a system that solved no instance of the family}{table.4.9}{}}
